<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 21/22.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 21/22.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Tuesday, April 22 on Monday</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   22.04.97	  21.04.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5324	    6.5292</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3505	    2.3296</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5812	   4.5536</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.1930	    3.1726</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5242	    0.5191</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7785	    0.7709</p>
<p>    EKK	  0.2938	    0.2912</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.8948	    6.8758</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6963	    0.6960</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2794	    1.2752</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
